Hand-written rules
------------------
One file needed more than an import rewrite. Each is spelled out here.

  pages/settings-dialog/page.tsx: `@astryxdesign/theme-neutral/built` has no Tecton equivalent: Tecton's theme is applied by `TectonProvider`, and `@tecton/react/theme` exposes only an opaque handle on it. The nested `<Theme theme={neutralTheme} mode>` becomes a nested `<TectonProvider scope="nested" mode>`, which is how Tecton renders a subtree in its own colour mode.

